<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- bngsim GH #1666 fixture (RuleWorld/nfsim#123), written by hand in BioNetGen 2.9.3's writeXML() -->
<!-- form. One A(s~0~1) flips at k0 and back at k1 beside a background birth at kb and a slow birth -->
<!-- at ks, listed last. The total moves between kb + k0 and kb + k1 and never falls far, and with -->
<!-- these rates NFsim's running sum, Atot - old + new, loses 2.2e-16 on every cycle, the same way. -->
